      <p>『もしもし、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61571-61589"><rb>燕</rb><rt>つばめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61589-61601">さん、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61601-61616"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61616-61628">さんは一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61628-61646"><rb>年</rb><rt>ねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61646-61652">に一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61652-61667"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61667-61682">づゝ、この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61682-61697"><rb>村</rb><rt>むら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61697-61700">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61700-61712"><rb>來</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61712-61742">るではありませんか。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61742-61757"><rb>遠</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61757-61760">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61760-61775"><rb>國</rb><rt>くに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61775-61778">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61778-61793"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61793-61796">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61796-61808"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61808-61814">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61814-61826"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61826-61832">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61832-61853"><rb>日本</rb><rt>にほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61853-61856">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61856-61877"><rb>言葉</rb><rt>ことば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61877-61880">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61880-61895"><rb>忘</rb><rt>わす</rt></ruby>れたのですか。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61922-61937"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61937-61946">さんが</s