      <p><seg source="#source-63834-63837">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63837-63864"><rb>私共</rb><rt>わたしども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63864-63867">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63867-63882"><rb>遠</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63882-63885">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63885-63900"><rb>國</rb><rt>くに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63900-63903">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63903-63918"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63918-63924">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63924-63939"><rb>參</rb><rt>まゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63939-63969">るものですから、なか</seg><choice source="#source-63969-63975"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63975-63996"><rb>言葉</rb><rt>ことば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63996-63999">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63999-64014"><rb>覺</rb><rt>おぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64014-64062">えられません、でも、あなたがたが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64062-64086"><rb>親切</rb><rt>しんせつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64086-64095">にして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64095-64110"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64110-64125">さるのを、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64125-64140"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64140-64146">より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64146-64170"><rb>有難</rb><rt>ありがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64170-64173">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64173-64188"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64188-64200">ひます。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64200-64218"><rb>鶫</rb><rt>つぐみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64218-64227">といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64227-64242"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg s