      <p><seg source="#source-65462-65465">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65465-65507"><rb>桃林和尚</rb><rt>たうりんをしやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65507-65510">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65510-65525"><rb>尋</rb><rt>たづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65525-65540">ねますと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65540-65558"><rb>狐</rb><rt>きつね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65558-65561">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65561-65573"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65573-65593">ふことには、</seg></p>
