      <p>『お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227166-227181"><rb>揃</rb><rt>そろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227181-227190">ひで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227190-227217"><rb>東京</rb><rt>とうきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227217-227220">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227220-227235"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227235-227241">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227241-227259"><rb>出掛</rb><rt>でか</rt></ruby>けですか。』<note type="base-edition" source="#source-227277-227346">底本では始めと終わりの二重かぎ括弧が脱字</note></p>
