      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233314-233329"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233329-233338">さんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233338-233365"><rb>東京</rb><rt>とうきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233365-233368">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233368-233380"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233380-233383">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233383-233404"><rb>時分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233404-233413">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233413-233437"><rb>鐵道</rb><rt>てつだう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233437-233446">のない</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233446-233461"><rb>頃</rb><rt>ころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233461-233476">ですから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233476-233494"><rb>是非</rb><rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233494-233500">とも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233500-233524"><rb>木曽路</rb><rt>きそぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233524-233527">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233527-233542"><rb>歩</rb><rt>ある</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233542-233557">かなければ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233557-233569"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233569-233599">りませんでした。もう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233599-233611"><rb>好</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233611-233614">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233614-233635"><rb>加減</rb><rt>かげん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233635-233650"><rb>歩</rb><rt>ある</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233650-233656">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233656-233668"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-233668-233677">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-233677-233692"><rb>谷</rb><r