      <p><seg source="#source-238974-238983">このお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-238983-238998"><rb>猿</rb><rt>さる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-238998-239007">さんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239007-239019"><rb>飼</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239019-239043">つてあるところは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239043-239058"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239058-239061">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239061-239076"><rb>崖</rb><rt>がけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239076-239079">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239079-239094"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239094-239106">でした。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239106-239121"><rb>橋</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239121-239124">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239124-239139"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239139-239142">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239142-239157"><rb>流</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239157-239163">れる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239163-239190"><rb>木曽川</rb><rt>きそがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239190-239199">がよく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239199-239211"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239211-239220">えて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239220-239235"><rb>深</rb><rt>ふか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239235-239238">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239238-239253"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239253-239256">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239256-239271"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239271-239283">らしい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239283-239304"><rb>景色</rb><rt>けしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239304-239307">の</seg><rub