      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239633-239648"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239648-239657">さんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239657-239684"><rb>東京</rb><rt>とうきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239684-239687">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239687-239699"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239699-239702">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239702-239720"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239720-239744">をしましたら、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239744-239759"><rb>猿</rb><rt>さる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239759-239768">さんも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239768-239786"><rb>羨</rb><rt>うらや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239786-239806">ましさうに、</seg></p>
      <p>『わたしも<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239821-239836"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239836-239839">つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239839-239872"><rb>金米糖</rb><rt>こんぺいたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239872-239878">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239878-239896"><rb>頂</rb><rt>いたゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239896-239905">いて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239905-239920"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239920-239932">さんのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239932-239947"><rb>供</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239947-239974">をしたいものです。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239974-239995"><rb>御覽</rb><rt>ごらん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-239995-239998">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-239998-240013"><rb>通</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240013-240037">り、わたしはこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240037-240061"><rb>棧橋</rb><rt>かけはし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240061-240064">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240064-240088"><rb>番人</rb><rt>ばんにん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240088-240100">でして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240100-240115"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240115-240127">さんのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240127-240142"><rb>供</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240142-240172">をしたいにも、こゝを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240172-240184"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240184-240193">いては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240193-240205"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240205-240238">かれません。まあ、この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240238-240253"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240253-240256">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240256-240271"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240271-240274">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240274-240307"><rb>土産話</rb><rt>みやげばなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240307-240328">に、そこにある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240328-240343"><rb>古</rb><rt>ふる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240343-240346">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240346-240361"><rb>石</rb><rt>いし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240361-240373">でもよく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240373-240385"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240385-240388">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240388-240400"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240400-240406">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240406-240421"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240421-240442">さい。これから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240442-240469"><rb>東京</rb><rt>とうきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240469-240475">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240475-240490"><rb>出</rb><rt>いで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240490-240520">になりましたら、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240520-240535"><rb>石</rb><rt>いし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240535-240538">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240538-240559"><rb>發句</rb><rt>ほつく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240559-240568">が一つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240568-240580"><rb>彫</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240580-240601">つてあつたとお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240601-240616"><rb>話</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240616-240619">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240619-240634"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240634-240649">さい。その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240649-240670"><rb>發句</rb><rt>ほつく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240670-240691">をつくつたのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240691-240709"><rb>昔</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-240709-240769"><lem>むかし</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-240757-240763">むか</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240769-240772">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240772-240802"><rb>芭蕉翁</rb><rt>ばせををう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240802-240823">といふ人だとお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240823-240838"><rb>話</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240838-240841">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240841-240856"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さい。』</p>
