      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240902-240920"><rb>伯父</rb><rt>をぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240920-240932">さんも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240932-240947"><rb>吉</rb><rt>きち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240947-240959">さんも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-240959-240986"><rb>友伯父</rb><rt>ともをぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-240986-241010">さんも、みんなお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241010-241025"><rb>猿</rb><rt>さる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241025-241034">さんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241034-241049"><rb>側</rb><rt>わき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241049-241052">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241052-241064"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241064-241076">まして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241076-241091"><rb>崖</rb><rt>がけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241091-241094">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241094-241109"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241109-241118">にある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241118-241133"><rb>古</rb><rt>ふる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241133-241136">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241136-241157"><rb>石碑</rb><rt>せきひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241157-241160">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241160-241178"><rb>文字</rb><rt>もじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241178-241181">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241181-241193"><rb>讀</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241193-241225">みました。それには、</seg></p>
