      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-241321-241339">六七　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241339-241360"><rb>山越</rb><rt>やまご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241360-241367">し</seg></p>
