      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241561-241576"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241576-241585">さんも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241585-241606"><rb>馬籠</rb><rt>まごめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241606-241618">のやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241618-241633"><rb>村</rb><rt>むら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241633-241636">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241636-241651"><rb>育</rb><rt>そだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241651-241657">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241657-241678"><rb>子供</rb><rt>こども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241678-241687">です。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241687-241711"><rb>山道</rb><rt>やまみち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241711-241714">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241714-241729"><rb>歩</rb><rt>ある</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241729-241738">くのに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241738-241750"><rb>慣</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241750-241759">れては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241759-241771"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby>ます。それにしても、『みさやま<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241816-241834"><rb>峠</rb><rt>たうげ</rt></ruby>』は<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241840-241858"><rb>見上</rb><rt>みあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241858-241873">げるやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241873-241888"><rb>險</rb><rt>けは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241888-241894">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241894-241918"><rb>山坂</rb><rt>やまさか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241918-241930">でした。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241930-241951"><rb>大人</rb><rt>おとな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-241951-241954">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241954-241969"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#so