      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-243890-243908">六八　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243908-243932"><rb>沓掛</rb><rt>くつかけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243932-243935">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243935-243968"><rb>温泉宿</rb><rt>をんせんやど</rt></ruby></p>
