      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248714-248735"><rb>太郎</rb><rt>たらう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248735-248741">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248741-248762"><rb>次郎</rb><rt>じらう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248762-248771">よ、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248771-248795"><rb>前達</rb><rt>まへたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248795-248798">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248798-248813"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248813-248831">きくなつたら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248831-248846"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248846-248855">さんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248855-248876"><rb>田舍</rb><rt>ゐなか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248876-248879">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248879-248894"><rb>訪</rb><rt>たづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248894-248900">ねて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248900-248912"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248912-248915">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-248915-248930"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-248930-248941">さい。</seg></p>
