      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249989-250004"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250004-250019">さんはこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250019-250043"><rb>少年</rb><rt>せうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250043-250046">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250046-250070"><rb>讀本</rb><rt>とくほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250070-250073">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250073-250085"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250085-250094">かうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250094-250109"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250109-250112">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250112-250124"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250124-250130">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250130-250145"><rb>頃</rb><rt>ころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250145-250151">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250151-250166"><rb>別</rb><rt>べつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250166-250181">につくつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250181-250193"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250193-250202">いたお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250202-250220"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby>が一つあります。それは『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250256-250283"><rb>兄弟</rb><rt>きやうだい</rt></ruby>』のお<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250292-250310"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250310-250334">です。それをこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250334-250349"><rb>本</rb><rt>ほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250349-250352">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250352-250367"><rb>後</rb><rt>のち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250367-250370">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250370-250382"><rb>添</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250382-250394">へようと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250394-250409"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250409-250423">ひます。</seg></p>
