      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250479-250494"><rb>早</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250494-250497">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250497-250509"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250509-250524">がさめても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250524-250542"><rb>何時</rb><rt>いつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250542-250551">までも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250551-250563"><rb>寢</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250563-250566">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250566-250578"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250578-250599">るのがいゝか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250599-250614"><rb>遲</rb><rt>おそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250614-250617">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250617-250629"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250629-250656">がさめてもむつくり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250656-250668"><rb>起</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250668-250707">きるのがいゝか、そのことで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250707-250734"><rb>兄弟</rb><rt>きやうだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250734-250737">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250737-250755"><rb>爭</rb><rt>あらそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250755-250761">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-250761-250773"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-250773-250787">ました。</seg></p>
